# Illogical Impulse — Control Center config module (issue #14).
#
# The root qmldir for the standalone `qs -p control` app. It exposes the two
# app-wide singletons every pane consumes: Colors (watches upstream's generated
# colors.json READ-ONLY, static fallback) and Ctl (the one Process wrapper that
# shells out to `iictl <verb>` — no pane touches the filesystem directly). The
# design-system component kit lives under _ui/ (its own qmldir); panes live under
# panes/. Nothing here imports upstream's quickshell/ii tree, so the Control
# Center survives any upstream rice redesign (same seam class as the welcome card).
singleton Colors 1.0 Colors.qml
singleton Ctl 1.0 Ctl.qml
